ecorators without a call are not recorded, a name the enclosing function binds locally is skipped, properties passed as values are skipped, arguments of inspect.* and of builtins that only examine a value (getattr, isinstance, print, repr and the like) are skipped, and every other receiving call is assumed, not proven, to invoke the reference.\", \"Builtin classification does not see local variables or parameters that shadow a builtin name.\", \"Inherited methods resolve only when the base class is statically resolvable to a definition in the repository; such calls are marked low confidence.\", \"Local variables that shadow a module-level name are not tracked, so a shadowed call may resolve to the module-level definition.\", \"Nested functions and classes defined inside a function are not symbols; their calls are attributed to the enclosing symbol.\", \"Test links are static: a test that exercises a file without importing it, and without a matching file name, is not linked.\", \"Descriptions and summaries are verbatim docstring text; no description is generated or inferred.\", \"Calls at module level, outside any function or class, are not recorded (1046 in this snapshot).\", \"3 module names are shared by several files (e.g. top-level test modules); imports of those names are not resolved.\"]","omitted_file_count":0,"repo_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/auto-ontology","snapshot_id":"cdaf61e1bd0c-158fe2236277","source_fingerprint":"158fe223627725d6"}}
